# Once the printer hook is installed, the ST runs no code in the cartridge:
# the hook is resident in RAM. An RP that restarts (a reflash, SELECT) stops
# serving the cartridge, and an ST running code there would crash. Our ESC/P
# pages (escp.st's AUTO folder) are printed while the watch is on, so the
# hook's output, its full-buffer sends and its idle flush all run.
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/disks/escp.st
text "Atari +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 1500
key f
key 0x1c
wait 100
key 0x01
wait 900
cartexec watch
key 0x39
cardfile PRINTER/*.PRN 2938 3000
cartexec none
